WEBVTT

1
00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:28.069
Let's go from here.

2
00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.280
- We must run away.
- Faster!

3
00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.365
Go all!

4
00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:34.159
Rather!

5
00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:35.577
Let's run away!

6
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.494
Let's run!

7
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.412
Well, because!

8
00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:42.208
- Let's go!
- Yolop!

9
00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.710
Let me go! Devil!

10
00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:45.545
I will kill him to pay!

11
00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:46.713
Run, fool!

12
00:03:02.765 --> 00:03:04.100
So you know?

13
00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.312
If you pull it out,

14
00:03:07.979 --> 00:03:08.813
you will die

15
00:03:55.276 --> 00:03:56.611
Damn, I'm in the ass.

16
00:03:58.029 --> 00:04:00.323
Shit, how am I supposed to clean it all up?

17
00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:08.873
Han Seok Yoon, Seoul Bureau of Investigation.

18
00:04:08.957 --> 00:04:10.583
There was a murder.

19
00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:11.584
Address…

20
00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:44.325
WITHOUT MERCY

21
00:04:44.409 --> 00:04:46.536
FAST HELP

22
00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:48.997
Okay, closer!

23
00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.374
Now turn it around! Good!

24
00:04:54.043 --> 00:04:56.587
Yes, now let's drop it. Go easy.

25
00:04:56.671 --> 00:04:58.631
That's it. Let's put

26
00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.928
That's it, can we go?

27
00:05:04.012 --> 00:05:06.014
Everything was washed away here.

28
00:05:07.515 --> 00:05:09.267
I would like to go home too.

29
00:05:09.892 --> 00:05:12.687
But the superiors ordered
first sort everything out.

30
00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.316
Because the inspection is coming to us.

31
00:05:16.941 --> 00:05:19.319
<i>There is a report - drowning</i>
<i>found near Hara Island.</i>

32
00:05:19.402 --> 00:05:20.737
Accepted.

33
00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.071
Let's go to Chara Island.

34
00:05:22.155 --> 00:05:24.073
To the island of Chara! And we take out the crane.

35
00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:25.950
- Remove the barriers!
- Let's roll up.

36
00:05:48.681 --> 00:05:51.100
Doctor, we are coming to you.

37
00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:54.645
Please be ready to receive it.

38
00:06:03.654 --> 00:06:06.199
The time of the accident is after the murder of Gu Jun Mo.

39
00:06:07.992 --> 00:06:09.327
Maybe check something?

40
00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:26.844
<i>You know why I'm calling, right?</i>

41
00:06:28.513 --> 00:06:30.056
<i>Let's meet immediately.</i>

42
00:06:59.127 --> 00:07:01.003
I feel for Jun Mo.

43
00:07:11.055 --> 00:07:13.433
Did you kill Gi Joon?

44
00:07:14.684 --> 00:07:16.227
What do you think?

45
00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:20.857
What could I even think about

46
00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:24.819
seeing the dead body of his only child?

47
00:07:26.362 --> 00:07:28.656
I think only about revenge.

48
00:07:29.991 --> 00:07:30.825
That's right.

49
00:07:31.909 --> 00:07:33.619
If you knew everything so well,

50
00:07:34.662 --> 00:07:36.205
then why did you do it?

51
00:07:51.012 --> 00:07:53.723
Detective Han
tampered with Nam Gi-seok's case.

52
00:07:55.183 --> 00:07:56.976
I researched how he was paid,

53
00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:00.855
and went out
to a front company from your corporation.

54
00:08:00.938 --> 00:08:03.065
{\an8}TRANSACTIONS
SENDER "CHW GALLERY"

55
00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:05.067
Do you want to know my opinion?

56
00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:07.278
You…

57
00:08:09.197 --> 00:08:12.241
just didn't plan to
to transfer his company to Gi Suk.

58
00:08:13.367 --> 00:08:16.078
You were going to kill him
hang it on Jun Mo

59
00:08:16.746 --> 00:08:20.291
and thus harass Gi Joon,
for him to kill Jun Mo.

60
00:08:20.374 --> 00:08:21.375
And then finally

61
00:08:23.336 --> 00:08:25.421
kill Gi Joon too,

62
00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.300
to convey everything

63
00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.595
to your miracle son, prosecutor.

64
00:08:34.805 --> 00:08:38.100
Is it better not to invent anything?
Like a cheap crime novel.

65
00:08:47.443 --> 00:08:48.361
Yes.

66
00:08:49.111 --> 00:08:50.905
This is the Lee Choo Woon I know.

67
00:08:51.405 --> 00:08:54.283
So many years have passed
and you still don't know me?

68
00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:55.284
You are wrong.

69
00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.745
You never knew me.

70
00:08:59.872 --> 00:09:00.790
And now,

71
00:09:02.291 --> 00:09:03.668
to make it end

72
00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:06.879
one of us has to disappear.

73
00:09:16.806 --> 00:09:18.391
<i>If it has already come to this,</i>

74
00:09:18.474 --> 00:09:19.684
let's get this over with.

75
00:09:19.767 --> 00:09:20.643
Well, because

76
00:09:21.143 --> 00:09:24.272
These are different times.
Blood should not be shed recklessly.

77
00:09:25.815 --> 00:09:29.819
So what to do? You just
let them get rid of us?

78
00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:33.573
Gu Bong San was out of his mind.
She thinks something.

79
00:09:33.656 --> 00:09:35.575
{\an8}Ignores the voice of reason.

80
00:09:35.658 --> 00:09:40.538
{\an8}BONSAN HEAD OFFICE

81
00:09:40.621 --> 00:09:41.622
{\an8}Well, how are you?

82
00:09:41.706 --> 00:09:45.334
I contacted everyone I could.
Told them where we were meeting.

83
00:09:47.295 --> 00:09:48.421
{\an8}BONSAN GANG BASE

84
00:09:48.504 --> 00:09:49.672
{\an8}Where is Mr. Chairman?

85
00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:50.590
Already coming here.

86
00:09:50.673 --> 00:09:51.924
Why is the meeting here?

87
00:09:52.008 --> 00:09:56.012
Hong Hyun Seok said
choose a place where "Chuvun" will not detect us.

88
00:09:56.095 --> 00:09:57.346
Did he say that?

89
00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.307
Is Bonsan afraid of the Chuwoon gang?

90
00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.349
- Who are you?
- Stand!

91
00:10:00.433 --> 00:10:01.267
Ahoy!

92
00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.811
- We are from the prosecutor's office.
- To the wall.

93
00:10:06.814 --> 00:10:09.233
That's the assembly, isn't it?

94
00:10:09.317 --> 00:10:10.526
Who are you anyway?

95
00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.738
Here is the warrant for the charge
in assault and intent to murder.

96
00:10:13.821 --> 00:10:15.573
You will learn the details later.

97
00:10:16.282 --> 00:10:17.408
Better cooperate.

98
00:10:17.491 --> 00:10:18.659
Take them away.

99
00:10:18.743 --> 00:10:19.994
Start on that side.

100
00:10:20.077 --> 00:10:21.412
Why don't you try?

101
00:10:21.495 --> 00:10:22.330
Take them out.

102
00:10:22.413 --> 00:10:25.374
By the way, how did you know we were here?

103
00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.884
All our people were arrested.

104
00:10:36.218 --> 00:10:38.971
A sudden roundup. There was nothing we could do.

105
00:10:40.097 --> 00:10:41.515
Lee Choo Woon.

106
00:10:42.016 --> 00:10:44.018
This son of a bitch must be…

107
00:10:45.144 --> 00:10:47.104
Sir, you need to get out of here.

108
00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.328
Goo Bong Sang!

109
00:11:02.411 --> 00:11:03.537
It's him!

110
00:11:05.456 --> 00:11:06.374
Devil!

111
00:11:08.876 --> 00:11:12.546
<i>Investigation is ongoing</i>
<i>prosecutors against Bonsan Corporation</i>

112
00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.091
<i>the president of the company is wanted,</i>

113
00:11:15.174 --> 00:11:17.093
<i>who escaped during the raid.</i>

114
00:11:17.176 --> 00:11:18.552
<i>When you served the warrant,</i>

115
00:11:19.136 --> 00:11:22.306
you had to wait
to take Gu Bong San too.

116
00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:26.852
It was hard to get in at the best time, huh?

117
00:11:28.896 --> 00:11:30.731
The investigators told me

118
00:11:30.815 --> 00:11:33.234
that you arrived 30 minutes early.

119
00:11:33.901 --> 00:11:36.737
Why? Did your father trick you?

120
00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:43.244
Your father made you do this
to protect your friend?

121
00:11:48.582 --> 00:11:51.210
I gave you the case
and you resorted to conspiracy?

122
00:11:53.003 --> 00:11:56.090
I hope you are ready.
Because for that you will be fired.

123
00:11:58.259 --> 00:11:59.552
Damn gangs.

124
00:12:00.344 --> 00:12:02.096
But you told me, right?

125
00:12:03.597 --> 00:12:06.559
That I have to pick a side and prove it.

126
00:12:10.813 --> 00:12:12.022
Here is my answer.

127
00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:17.445
You're starting to scare me.

128
00:12:25.995 --> 00:12:29.290
Next after Gu Bong San is my father.

129
00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.336
And you will cope with it?

130
00:12:35.004 --> 00:12:36.088
I'm ready for it

131
00:12:37.423 --> 00:12:39.550
since that day

132
00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:43.137
when he came to the prosecutor's office.

133
00:13:00.196 --> 00:13:01.030
Mr. Chairman.

134
00:13:01.697 --> 00:13:02.531
What?

135
00:13:03.699 --> 00:13:05.951
Why didn't you call?

136
00:13:06.619 --> 00:13:08.788
I wasn't expecting you today.

137
00:13:09.747 --> 00:13:11.290
Yes, that's the point.

138
00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:13.000
We have been for a long time

139
00:13:13.751 --> 00:13:16.086
meet only when you want.

140
00:13:16.712 --> 00:13:18.214
Why should I agree?

141
00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:21.634
Is something bothering you?

142
00:13:21.717 --> 00:13:22.635
Yes.

143
00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:25.137
you told me

144
00:13:25.971 --> 00:13:28.557
that I can control the flow of the game.

145
00:13:29.058 --> 00:13:33.062
That 11 years ago I had no choice
but now everything is different.

146
00:13:34.897 --> 00:13:35.815
Yes.

147
00:13:36.482 --> 00:13:37.775
I remember these words.

148
00:13:37.858 --> 00:13:40.236
But I still have no choice.

149
00:13:44.865 --> 00:13:46.492
why did you do that

150
00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:49.995
Who? So Cha Yeon Do?

151
00:13:52.289 --> 00:13:53.457
Wait.

152
00:13:56.293 --> 00:13:58.128
You think it's me

153
00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.840
hunted for "Bonsan"?

154
00:14:00.923 --> 00:14:03.551
I'm not talking about Bonsan.

155
00:14:07.972 --> 00:14:10.933
I didn't see
but payments were made from my account.

156
00:14:11.016 --> 00:14:14.186
It was paid to not just anyone, but to Detective Khan.

157
00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.897
After which the murder of Gi Seok happened,

158
00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:21.402
and it was Khan who took up the cause
and quickly hid the ends in the water.

159
00:14:22.611 --> 00:14:26.073
as far as i know
only one person could organize it.

160
00:14:28.367 --> 00:14:29.577
So tell me.

161
00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:31.954
Why did you do that?

162
00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.795
There is a major flaw in your logic sir.

163
00:14:41.672 --> 00:14:44.967
Create a shell company,
bribe the policeman

164
00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.802
falsify case materials...

165
00:14:48.762 --> 00:14:50.014
And so on.

166
00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:55.060
In addition to me, one more person can do all this.

167
00:14:55.144 --> 00:14:56.395
Some from the prosecutor's office.

168
00:14:58.522 --> 00:14:59.732
why don't you think

169
00:15:00.232 --> 00:15:02.943
that is one of yours? But no...

170
00:15:05.154 --> 00:15:07.781
Because you want to believe it, right?

171
00:15:07.865 --> 00:15:11.702
If you're really into it
my son, I will break your head.

172
00:15:13.787 --> 00:15:15.664
At one time I was told

173
00:15:16.999 --> 00:15:19.043
that the older people are,

174
00:15:19.126 --> 00:15:21.712
the more they believe in
what they want to believe.

175
00:15:26.467 --> 00:15:27.426
All the best.

176
00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:29.762
take care

177
00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.097
himself.

178
00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:34.516
Thank you.

179
00:16:08.092 --> 00:16:09.593
- Have you had dinner yet?
- Yes.

180
00:16:22.606 --> 00:16:24.858
Here's the Gi Seok stuff you asked for.

181
00:16:28.654 --> 00:16:31.907
And this is the key to his car.

182
00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:40.124
I changed the numbers
so don't worry about being found.

183
00:16:51.135 --> 00:16:52.261
Well done.

184
00:16:54.096 --> 00:16:54.930
That's good.

185
00:16:55.014 --> 00:16:57.808
Good thing that scumbag Gu Bong San is gone.

186
00:16:58.392 --> 00:17:01.729
After all, this is his stupid son
got us all into this shit.

187
00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:03.522
Exactly. It's all that goat.

188
00:17:03.605 --> 00:17:09.069
By the way, Lee Choo Woon's son is alone, as you might think
ordered a mask show for the Bonsan group?

189
00:17:09.153 --> 00:17:10.738
But who knows.

190
00:17:11.238 --> 00:17:13.907
Or did he do it to make a name for himself

191
00:17:14.491 --> 00:17:16.243
or Lee Choo Wong forced him.

192
00:17:18.412 --> 00:17:22.124
But who cares?
What are we here for anyway?

193
00:17:26.462 --> 00:17:27.880
- Agov, Yan Siku.
- What?

194
00:17:32.134 --> 00:17:34.803
Don't think too much about it, okay?

195
00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:36.305
- What do I always say?
- Yes.

196
00:17:36.388 --> 00:17:38.307
The one who survived is the strongest.

197
00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.684
Look at Nam Gi Joon.

198
00:17:40.768 --> 00:17:44.855
This pathetic loser
should have just remained silent, then he would have lived on.

199
00:17:44.938 --> 00:17:47.483
But no, the fool wanted revenge.

200
00:17:47.566 --> 00:17:50.152
What's the point of being the coolest
if you are dead

201
00:17:50.235 --> 00:17:52.446
You are right. He is a fool.

202
00:17:55.324 --> 00:17:56.617
It's a hatchling.

203
00:17:57.242 --> 00:18:00.996
I saved his life
and he still climbed into the place where he was killed.

204
00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.081
Unbelievable.

205
00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.085
I have to talk to him.

206
00:18:06.168 --> 00:18:07.294
- Huh?
- One on one.

207
00:18:07.795 --> 00:18:08.629
Of course.

208
00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.424
Your mother is shaking. Thank God.

209
00:18:14.218 --> 00:18:16.428
Could at least knock or something.

210
00:18:22.434 --> 00:18:23.477
sit down

211
00:18:26.688 --> 00:18:27.689
Who did it?

212
00:18:28.524 --> 00:18:29.399
What exactly?

213
00:18:29.483 --> 00:18:31.026
Who killed me?

214
00:18:32.236 --> 00:18:34.655
Oh well, Gi Joon. How should I know that?

215
00:18:34.738 --> 00:18:39.701
And you are alive! what do you mean
asking who killed you?

216
00:18:39.785 --> 00:18:40.619
Then find out.

217
00:18:41.912 --> 00:18:43.330
Because I'm not asking.

218
00:18:44.331 --> 00:18:46.166
I give you a chance to survive.

219
00:18:50.129 --> 00:18:51.880
What about Chun Seok and Pyeong Ho?

220
00:18:52.756 --> 00:18:55.175
THE LATE CHWE PYONG HO
THE LATE KIM CHUNG SOK

221
00:18:55.217 --> 00:18:58.387
I wanted to do everything as usual
and it seemed evil.

222
00:18:58.887 --> 00:19:01.306
So I gave them a proper funeral.

223
00:19:02.766 --> 00:19:04.434
Damn expensive

224
00:19:04.518 --> 00:19:05.894
over 14 million…

225
00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:09.273
No, forget it. It doesn't matter who paid.

226
00:19:12.776 --> 00:19:14.278
Because they are stupid.

227
00:19:15.612 --> 00:19:17.781
Why did they show off?

228
00:19:19.783 --> 00:19:23.245
And they could live quietly, like me.

229
00:19:45.559 --> 00:19:46.727
That's where you are.

230
00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:03.493
You don't want to tell me anything?

231
00:20:04.578 --> 00:20:08.123
If we are talking about "Bonsan",
I couldn't do anything.

232
00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:11.960
The management planned
this raid has been around for a long time.

233
00:20:12.669 --> 00:20:15.589
- I was following orders...
- Did you talk to someone recently?

234
00:20:18.634 --> 00:20:19.468
Who are you talking about?

235
00:20:21.303 --> 00:20:22.471
Cha Yeon Do.

236
00:20:23.055 --> 00:20:24.556
That is, Mr. Kim.

237
00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:26.266
What did he tell you?

238
00:20:27.476 --> 00:20:29.770
What will help you enter this world?

239
00:20:32.689 --> 00:20:35.150
What will help you take my place?

240
00:20:38.403 --> 00:20:40.781
Father, what are you...

241
00:20:47.037 --> 00:20:49.957
you always said

242
00:20:51.041 --> 00:20:53.293
that I have no place in the Chuvun company.

243
00:20:53.794 --> 00:20:55.087
I think so myself.

244
00:20:55.796 --> 00:20:57.673
It really is, I know.

245
00:20:58.382 --> 00:21:02.094
To be honest, I have no idea
what are you talking about now

246
00:21:02.886 --> 00:21:05.764
I just do my job diligently.

247
00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:09.518
Besides, nothing will change,

248
00:21:10.519 --> 00:21:12.437
while you're at it, right?

249
00:21:17.442 --> 00:21:18.318
take a rest

250
00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.054
Stop!

251
00:21:48.807 --> 00:21:49.683
This is Chuvun!

252
00:21:49.766 --> 00:21:51.393
Infection!

253
00:21:54.271 --> 00:21:55.939
Sir, this is people from Chuvun.

254
00:21:58.358 --> 00:21:59.693
you must go

255
00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:05.949
<i>I have been an observer since Mr. O. died</i>

256
00:22:07.993 --> 00:22:10.370
I have always left it up to others to decide.

257
00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:15.167
That's how I managed to survive
and don't get your hands dirty.

258
00:22:16.209 --> 00:22:18.754
But I was very wrong.

259
00:22:19.254 --> 00:22:23.008
My hands were deep in the dirt.
I just didn't notice it.

260
00:22:23.925 --> 00:22:24.885
So,

261
00:22:26.053 --> 00:22:27.971
since i'm already in this mess

262
00:22:28.513 --> 00:22:31.475
then I can once again, for the last time,
get your hands dirty sir.

263
00:22:47.532 --> 00:22:48.658
I will detain them.

264
00:22:51.286 --> 00:22:52.120
Import it.

265
00:23:17.938 --> 00:23:18.939
Ahoy!

266
00:23:21.525 --> 00:23:22.442
Stand!

267
00:23:27.572 --> 00:23:28.407
Ahoy!

268
00:23:49.177 --> 00:23:50.053
Well, because!

269
00:23:50.846 --> 00:23:52.097
What else can you do?

270
00:23:58.562 --> 00:23:59.438
Wait.

271
00:24:37.142 --> 00:24:38.643
Let everyone come out.

272
00:24:52.157 --> 00:24:53.533
I'm sorry.

273
00:24:54.201 --> 00:24:55.702
No need for this.

274
00:25:00.790 --> 00:25:02.542
It always happens that way...

275
00:25:04.711 --> 00:25:06.505
with people like us.

276
00:25:12.802 --> 00:25:15.013
I am the same as you.

277
00:25:16.139 --> 00:25:18.558
I am capable of anything for the sake of my son.

278
00:25:19.768 --> 00:25:21.186
I hope you understand.

279
00:25:24.272 --> 00:25:25.649
don't stop

280
00:25:27.317 --> 00:25:29.611
Soon it will be your turn.

281
00:26:08.900 --> 00:26:09.734
let's go

282
00:26:16.032 --> 00:26:16.950
Mr. Gu

283
00:26:17.993 --> 00:26:19.119
really dead

284
00:26:19.202 --> 00:26:21.079
Clear. That's good.

285
00:26:22.038 --> 00:26:23.248
As I promised

286
00:26:23.748 --> 00:26:26.293
now you are the boss of Bonsan Corporation.

287
00:26:28.378 --> 00:26:29.671
So it is.

288
00:26:41.641 --> 00:26:43.935
do you see It is worth being kinder.

289
00:26:44.019 --> 00:26:46.062
GU BON SAN
GU JUNG MO

290
00:26:49.274 --> 00:26:51.401
LEE CHU WUN
NAM GI SOK

291
00:26:54.988 --> 00:26:57.616
LEE CHU WUN

292
00:26:58.742 --> 00:27:00.910
I was called by the company "Chuvun",

293
00:27:00.994 --> 00:27:03.371
to clean up the traces of the attack on Bonsan.

294
00:27:04.456 --> 00:27:06.249
But something is wrong here.

295
00:27:08.043 --> 00:27:11.254
The Lee Choo Woon I know
would not go for it.

296
00:27:12.922 --> 00:27:14.424
He decided so...

297
00:27:17.177 --> 00:27:18.928
because he wants to protect something.

298
00:27:19.888 --> 00:27:21.723
So much so that he killed Gu Bong San.

299
00:27:46.998 --> 00:27:47.832
Who is this?

300
00:28:14.651 --> 00:28:17.404
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

301
00:28:25.286 --> 00:28:28.248
So... How are you doing?

302
00:28:51.104 --> 00:28:52.147
Well, of course.

303
00:28:52.230 --> 00:28:54.274
I knew you wouldn't die so easily.

304
00:28:56.109 --> 00:28:58.194
I think you have a question for me.

305
00:28:58.278 --> 00:28:59.446
It's you...

306
00:29:01.865 --> 00:29:03.908
ordered my murder?

307
00:29:06.077 --> 00:29:07.871
Just like how Goo killed Bong San?

308
00:29:14.711 --> 00:29:16.629
There are some you don't know about.

309
00:29:20.300 --> 00:29:23.386
You once arranged the pieces

310
00:29:24.763 --> 00:29:29.434
and he controlled the game
since you disappeared

311
00:29:31.561 --> 00:29:33.188
We call him Mr. Kim.

312
00:29:33.271 --> 00:29:34.105
<i>Come in.</i>

313
00:29:44.741 --> 00:29:45.742
say hello

314
00:29:47.744 --> 00:29:48.787
Nice to meet you.

315
00:29:48.870 --> 00:29:52.457
<i>Chief O introduced it</i>
<i>into our affairs through connections in the police.</i>

316
00:29:59.297 --> 00:30:01.758
Major Cha Yeon Do, I salute you.

317
00:30:02.258 --> 00:30:05.261
<i>He leaked police data to us</i>

318
00:30:05.345 --> 00:30:08.598
<i>and helped to hide</i>
<i>our illegal transactions.</i>

319
00:30:16.231 --> 00:30:20.318
VETERANS' QUARTERS

320
00:30:25.990 --> 00:30:29.828
<i>At first, Mr. Kim was not too greedy.</i>

321
00:30:31.204 --> 00:30:33.122
- How are you?
- Congratulations.

322
00:30:41.047 --> 00:30:44.050
- Glad to see you.
- Mutually.

323
00:30:44.133 --> 00:30:48.888
<i>And after the death of chief O</i>
<i>he did not leave this activity.</i>

324
00:30:52.809 --> 00:30:56.813
<i>He stayed with me and Bon San</i>
<i>and made a lot of money.</i>

325
00:30:57.939 --> 00:31:00.316
THE SECRET OFFICE OF MR KIM

326
00:31:00.400 --> 00:31:03.736
<i>Much more,</i>
<i>than he earned during the time of Mr. O.</i>

327
00:31:13.705 --> 00:31:17.792
<i>But even that was not enough for him.</i>

328
00:31:20.003 --> 00:31:22.672
<i>He pressed on our weak points</i>

329
00:31:23.798 --> 00:31:26.634
<i>and managed us from behind the scenes.</i>

330
00:31:27.760 --> 00:31:28.595
<i>That is</i>

331
00:31:29.721 --> 00:31:31.180
<i>exactly</i>

332
00:31:31.848 --> 00:31:34.350
<i>we still kept the peace.</i>

333
00:31:37.979 --> 00:31:39.022
But then...

334
00:31:42.150 --> 00:31:43.776
Suddenly I realized.

335
00:31:44.402 --> 00:31:45.862
And then and now too,

336
00:31:47.530 --> 00:31:52.035
maybe not you
Mr. Kim started all this.

337
00:31:54.078 --> 00:31:58.041
Because I still can't figure out something.
Gi Seok was a nobody 11 years ago.

338
00:31:59.042 --> 00:32:02.462
Where did he get it from?
information about Mr. O's son?

339
00:32:08.801 --> 00:32:09.636
<i>So,</i>

340
00:32:10.887 --> 00:32:12.597
<i>if I kill the son of Chief Oh...</i>

341
00:32:12.680 --> 00:32:14.724
<i>I didn't tell you to kill him.</i>

342
00:32:15.224 --> 00:32:18.978
<i>I'm just saying,</i>
<i>that he is hunting your brother.</i>

343
00:32:19.479 --> 00:32:21.230
<i>That's it, yes.</i>

344
00:32:25.401 --> 00:32:28.613
It was Mr. Kim who leaked this information to Gi-seok.

345
00:32:30.531 --> 00:32:32.617
I understand if you don't believe me.

346
00:32:33.201 --> 00:32:36.996
But you have to know something.
He pulls the strings again.

347
00:32:37.497 --> 00:32:41.417
Gi Seok is dead
so now he's bringing you into it.

348
00:32:43.336 --> 00:32:44.712
Like 11 years ago.

349
00:32:51.678 --> 00:32:54.055
I was really going to transfer my business

350
00:32:55.139 --> 00:32:56.182
Gi Suk.

351
00:32:58.017 --> 00:32:59.852
But now that he's gone

352
00:32:59.936 --> 00:33:02.563
i can't trust anyone in the corporation.

353
00:33:04.315 --> 00:33:05.692
That's why I...

354
00:33:07.568 --> 00:33:08.945
I want you Gi Joon

355
00:33:09.654 --> 00:33:11.322
headed by "Chuvun".

356
00:33:13.825 --> 00:33:15.451
Now, as before,

357
00:33:16.160 --> 00:33:17.662
I will not change my decision.

358
00:33:24.585 --> 00:33:25.837
where i can

359
00:33:26.337 --> 00:33:27.922
find this person?

360
00:33:28.548 --> 00:33:30.425
I will bring him to you myself.

361
00:34:09.797 --> 00:34:11.674
DIRECTOR LEE CHOO WUN
INCOMING CALL

362
00:34:13.843 --> 00:34:14.844
Yes, Mr. Chairman.

363
00:34:17.180 --> 00:34:18.097
Right now?

364
00:34:18.848 --> 00:34:22.226
SEOUL CITY POLICE

365
00:34:39.118 --> 00:34:44.373
WITHOUT MERCY

366
00:34:45.291 --> 00:34:48.252
But why me?

367
00:34:48.336 --> 00:34:50.546
I am not the only director at Bonsan.

368
00:34:52.673 --> 00:34:53.674
Mr. Hon,

369
00:34:54.759 --> 00:34:56.844
let me also ask something.

370
00:34:58.262 --> 00:34:59.931
How about Chuvun?

371
00:35:01.349 --> 00:35:05.520
who do you think
should lead the company after Lee Choo Woon?

372
00:35:08.731 --> 00:35:10.983
Nam Gi Seok is dead, he's out of the game.

373
00:35:11.734 --> 00:35:13.569
Pak is too old school.

374
00:35:14.070 --> 00:35:15.863
To the exclusion of all others,

375
00:35:16.572 --> 00:35:17.824
maybe Choi Song Chol?

376
00:35:18.324 --> 00:35:19.784
So, because

377
00:35:21.327 --> 00:35:23.871
That's why I chose you.

378
00:35:29.669 --> 00:35:32.755
I excluded everyone else,
and only you are left.

379
00:35:40.888 --> 00:35:41.764
you drink

380
00:35:50.064 --> 00:35:51.232
Yes, please.

381
00:35:59.574 --> 00:36:00.741
Long time no see.

382
00:36:02.869 --> 00:36:04.412
So, I do know him.

383
00:36:06.873 --> 00:36:09.750
Really? But I was told otherwise.

384
00:36:11.294 --> 00:36:13.713
He was not on your list, Mr. Hon.

385
00:36:14.839 --> 00:36:16.382
but in Chuvun Corporation

386
00:36:17.842 --> 00:36:19.552
there is already a legitimate successor.

387
00:36:22.513 --> 00:36:24.432
Here he is.

388
00:36:37.445 --> 00:36:38.446
So…

389
00:36:41.115 --> 00:36:42.658
are you sure you're ready?

390
00:39:51.764 --> 00:39:57.978
Translation of subtitles: Olga Tsiatska

